  "emp.hero.h1": "Professionals who truly strengthen your site.",
  "emp.hero.lead": "Meda is your language and communication partner in workforce placement — with over two years of practice and direct HR experience as a former Area Manager. We accompany every candidate through every step: from contracts to visa and residence timelines through ongoing support. Every process is traceable, documented and run compliantly. That builds a reliable, scalable solution — so you can focus on your core business.",
  "emp.hero.alt": "Professional interview with European specialists",
  "emp.h2.1": "What you receive",
  "emp.li1": "Sector-specific search in healthcare, engineering, logistics and IT",
  "emp.li2": "Screening for academic degree and German proficiency",
  "emp.li3": "Short, reliable shortlists instead of unsorted applicant pools",
  "emp.li4": "Transparent communication on recognition, visa and start date",
  "emp.li5": "Integration support for candidates placed by MEDA Vermittlung",
  "emp.h2.2": "Who we work with",
  "emp.p2": "Hospitals and clinic groups, industrial and technology companies, logistics providers, and IT/digital organisations needing highly qualified permanent staff.",
  "emp.h2.3": "Compliance clarity",
  "emp.p3": "We provide pure placement. We do not offer temporary staffing (Arbeitnehmerüberlassung) without the required AÜG licence.",
  "emp.cta": "Submit a hiring need",
  "emp.img.alt": "Handshake at onboarding in a German office",
  "pro.hero.h1": "Your path to Ausbildung or a permanent role in Germany.",
  "pro.hero.lead": "Three clear tracks: Ausbildung, healthcare professionals or other roles. Choose path, language and experience — then see a matching demo with sample offers.",
  "pro.hero.alt": "Professional in an interview setting",
  "pro.h2.1": "What we look for",
  "pro.li1": "Fitting track: Ausbildung, healthcare professional or other skilled role",
  "pro.li2": "German B1 or B2 (C1 welcome) — ideally with evidence",
  "pro.li3": "Experience or a clear entry intention depending on the role",
  "pro.li4": "Willingness for training or permanent employment and relocation to Germany",
  "pro.h2.2": "What we do for you",
  "pro.p2": "Profile matching, interview preparation, orientation on visa and recognition — and, after a successful placement, integration help for housing, banking and everyday life.",
  "pro.h2.3": "Source markets",
  "pro.p3": "We identify talent across Europe and — via valid Germany pathways — also in North Africa and further regions. The standard is qualification and language, not a single origin country.",
  "pro.cta": "Submit your profile",
  "pro.img.alt": "Professionals in a meeting setting",
  "svc.hero.h1": "Services with boutique depth.",
  "svc.hero.lead": "From briefing to integration: placement for highly qualified profiles — transparent and sector-sharp.",
  "svc.c1.h": "Executive & specialist search",
