  "mo.h1": "Settling in Germany, step by step.",
  "mo.position": "MEDA One is MEDA Vermittlung’s companion app for skilled professionals from abroad: it connects job placement with settling in Germany — from pre-arrival prep through Day 1, Week 1 and Month 1 to orientation for the “Leben in Deutschland” test, with Ask MEDA as an AI assistant in German, English, French and Arabic.",
  "mo.cap.cl": "Day-1 checklist",
  "mo.draft": "Design draft",
  "mo.lead": "New country, new city, new rules, all at once. With MEDA One we are building an app that guides skilled professionals from abroad from the first visa appointment to the moment they feel at home. It brings together a personal checklist with deadlines, a clear plan for day one, explanations in German, English, French and Arabic, and direct routes to the official services: Bürgeramt, 116117, Familienkasse. Your documents stay on your device. And when you need a person, your MEDA contact is there.",
